      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Resolve Endpoint Policy\nlocal_only: mutating paths (object writes, props writes, CRDT writes, mapred POST)\nlocal_first: read paths (object read, keys, index, query, props read)\nremote_forward: explicit single-target forwarding only\naggregate_read: /api/dcs + /api/cluster/status fanout/merge",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
