      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Resolve Endpoint Policy\nlocal_only: mutating paths (object writes, props writes, CRDT writes, mapred POST)\nlocal_first: read paths (object read, keys, index, query, props read)\nremote_forward: explicit single-target forwarding only\naggregate_read: /api/dcs + /api/cluster/status fanout/merge",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
