      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Execute + Return Contract\nlocal_only/local_first success: preserve existing status + headers\nremote_forward failure: 503 dc_unreachable/dc_timeout\naggregate_read partial success: 200 partial=true + unavailable_dcs\nall responses keep request_id and DC attribution headers",
      "fontSize": 16,
